ou) it will hit them. (Additionally, when turning off death notes, it will still attempt to hit where they WOULD be, leading to a miss)","tags":["fnf","fridaynightfunkin","projectafternight","autoplay","autoplayer"],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://api.luarmor.net/files/v4/loaders/5cbf1b6cbc7497f53f2cdf95d030614f.lua\"))()","owner":{"_id":"6745f72fffbb3fc0f8744dc9","username":"Violetta","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/photo/6745f72fffbb3fc0f8744dc9-1753040569090.png","status":"offline","id":"6745f72fffbb3fc0f8744dc9","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1}},"verified":false,"views":8862,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":true,"visibility":"public","image":"/images/sb/13042495892-1773582957693.png","likeCount":3,"dislikeCount":1,"createdAt":"2026-03-15T13:55:57.711Z","keyLink":"","executes":548,"keyless":false,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"69b6ba6d91b8fc510cb55183","editBy":{"_id":"6745f72fffbb3fc0f8744dc9","username":"Violetta","status":"offline","id":"6745f72fffbb3fc0f8744dc9"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2026-03-15T13:55:57.714Z"}],"comments":[{"_id":"69f59eb49c783d95c8b6da80","commentBy":{"_id":"69f59dcd4fa7ab5c7b2e18b8","username":"svnth","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":"/images/photo/69f59dcd4fa7ab5c7b2e18b8-1777705393450.jpg","lastActive":"2026-05-10T04:22:57.815Z","createdAt":"2026-05-02T06:46:37.570Z","status":"offline","id":"69f59dcd4fa7ab5c7b2e18b8"},"text":"Did some testing and, it really works, multi-key support and no problem at all (the base delay option was goated) but still, it doesnt detect when the song have more than one chart in one side (a.k.a other character in your side with their notes) also the mentioned custom notes and allat, still goated, sadly is closed-source, ggs (edit: after some time, the script cant really keep up and just starts to become useless)","edited":true,"likeCount":2,"dislikeCount":0,"cre